flowchart TD
    A[Container starts] --> B{Startup probe configured?}
    B -- Yes --> C{Startup succeeds?}
    C -- No --> R[Restart after failure threshold]
    C -- Yes --> D[Run readiness and liveness]
    B -- No --> D
    D --> E{Readiness succeeds?}
    E -- No --> F[Pod not Ready; remove from Service endpoints]
    E -- Yes --> G[Pod eligible for traffic]
    D --> H{Liveness succeeds?}
    H -- No --> R
    H -- Yes --> I[Continue running]
